    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Positioned in a quiet cul-de-sac overlooking a green, 185 The Links offers a fantastic opportunity to acquire a spacious family home in this mature and highly sought-after location. The property provides generous accommodation, a practical layout, and excellent potential to create a stylish, long-term family residence.\r\nThe property has been extended and features four bedrooms, an attic conversion, and a large kitchen opening to a west-facing rear garden—ideal for evening sunshine."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch / Hall:\r\nUPVC double-glazed front door, wood-style flooring, coving, recessed and spot lighting, and under-stair storage.\r\n\r\nGuest WC:\r\nWhite suite with extractor fan, tiled walls and floor.\r\n\r\nLiving Room (3.90m x 5.60m):\r\nBay window overlooking the green, open fireplace, wood-style flooring, coving, and wall lighting.\r\n\r\nDining Room (3.10m x 3.80m):\r\nCoving, wood flooring, patio doors opening to rear garden.\r\n\r\nKitchen (2.80m x 6.15m):\r\nExtended kitchen with wall and floor units, tiled splashback, breakfast counter, and fitted appliances including oven, hob, extractor, and fridge-freezer.\r\n\r\nFirst Floor:\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 (3.75m x 3.80m): Built-in wardrobes, recessed lighting, wood-style flooring.\r\n\r\nEn-suite: White suite with tiled walls and floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (3.05m x 3.30m): Built-in storage, recessed lighting, wood flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 (2.20m x 1.75m): Slider robes, recessed lighting.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4 (2.25m x 2.40m): Bookshelf, recessed lighting, wood-style flooring.\r\n\r\nBathroom (1.70m x 2.15m): Full bathroom suite, tiled walls and floor.\r\n\r\nAttic Conversion (4.60m x 4.85m):\r\n\r\nBright and versatile space with six Velux windows, recessed lighting, and wood flooring. Ideal as a home office, playroom, or guest area."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Attic conversion \r\nUpvc doubled glazed windows\r\nExtended Kitchen\r\n2 Reception Rooms\r\nShower ensuite & DSWC\r\nFacing green in Cul de sac\r\nWest facing aspect \r\nLarge concrete shed"
      },
